# What never belongs in the build context of `examples/basic/Dockerfile`, whose context is this
# directory: installed trees (pnpm's are symlink farms that mean nothing in another filesystem),
# build outputs the image builds for itself, and the repository's own history.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.claude
coverage
